{"id":"n14143-2-7","stage":3,"title":"예비 · 预备","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14143-2-7-1","ko":"예비 신랑님, 사진 찍을 때 조금 더 활짝 웃어 주세요.","zh":"准新郎先生，拍照的时候请多笑开一点哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예비","meaning":"预备","explanation":"예비：预备。","readings":[{"term":"예비","audio":"/audio/c3c9f0950926dc5c32b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14143","senseId":"2","lemma":"예비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예비","audio":"/audio/c3c9f0950926dc5c32b1.mp3"}},{"text":"신랑님,","meaning":"新郎","explanation":"신랑：新郎；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"신랑","audio":"/audio/3f32bdb17f0b871cbeeb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65331","senseId":"1","lemma":"신랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신랑님","audio":"/audio/13e509ed199a7d1f7025.mp3"}},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}},{"text":"찍을","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍을","audio":"/audio/833be0528b5e5414f676.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"sur